# Water monomer in SMD(water), r2SCAN-3c
# Purpose: SMD(water) Opt + Freq + KeepDens at r2SCAN-3c, to match the level
#   used for the water tetramer (water-smd/4Water/..._restart) and for the
#   MeOH monomer (MeOH/Monomer.inp), so a like-for-like comparison of
#   interaction/stabilization energies is possible.
#
# NOTE: the existing water-smd/water_smd.inp is at a different level
#   (B3LYP/def2-SVP/D3BJ, SMD(water)) - this new calculation is the
#   r2SCAN-3c counterpart needed for consistency with the tetramer.

! r2SCAN-3c TightSCF Opt Freq KeepDens SMD(water)

* xyz 0 1
O   0.0   0.0   0.1
H   0.0   0.7  -0.4
H   0.0  -0.7  -0.4
*
